OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA clear and cool start for
OL,6,Fmany, showers lingering along the
OL,7,Fcoast. Cloud gradually thickens
OL,8,Fthroughout the day, with rain and
OL,9,Fstrengthening winds arriving early
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOvercast with rain, moderate
OL,13,For heavy at times, spreading eastwards
OL,14,Facross the whole of the region by the
OL,15,Fmorning. Winds will strengthen and
OL,16,Flocally blustery along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
